---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Upstream projects
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

Mono-Dash
  A third-party mobile management app for 1Panel.
  License: GPL-3.0
  Source: https://github.com/nowubh/Mono-Dash
  Used as the source of the 1Panel protocol/data layer (lib/data, lib/domain,
  lib/core/network, lib/core/storage, lib/core/utils). Semantics preserved;
  import paths and platform-specific sync branches adjusted.

Kazumi
  An open-source anime streaming application.
  License: GPL-3.0
  Source: https://github.com/Predidit/Kazumi
  Used as the visual-language reference (Material 3 theme construction,
  tonal card, split list group, bottom sheet geometry, motion tokens).
  No Kazumi source code is copied.

1Panel
  An open-source Linux server operation and management panel.
  License: GPL-3.0
  Source: https://github.com/1Panel-dev/1Panel
  Consumed through its public HTTP/WebSocket API. No 1Panel source is bundled.

